{
  "name": "@youlian/dsh-learning",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "智能助理学院：可装卸的 DSH 学习插件。0.8.0 换成全文精读引擎：原文切成片段账本（lib/ledger.js），确定性 Planner 排好路线（lib/plan.js），逐片精读并在每片校验覆盖、引用、数值/条款号/型号、表格行、笔记字数与说明充分性，不过就回退重拆、超限停下等人；校验通过后停在人工复核，点头才按条款出题、绑定双向溯源并写入知识库与 ReMe（lib/engine.js、lib/commit.js）。",
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./locale/en.json": "./locale/en.json",
    "./locale/zh.json": "./locale/zh.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/pipeline.js",
    "lib/ledger.js",
    "lib/plan.js",
    "lib/engine.js",
    "lib/commit.js",
    "lib/contract.js",
    "lib/divergence.js",
    "lib/classroom.js",
    "lib/library.js",
    "lib/teaching.js",
    "lib/academy.js",
    "lib/academy.html",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/extract.py",
    "locale/",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "make-index": "node scripts/make-market-index.mjs"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.2-rc.2"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ]
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
